    - key: 104
      value:
        matchups: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 06d3083dadc16bb4ea8e64a692ecfa1e, type: 2}
        description: 'Subjugator-class dreadnought: 34 turbolaser batteries, 20 laser
          batteries and 8 shield-piercing Mass Drivers. Ion Pulse disables enemy
          ships; a malfunction can disable Malevolence. Four hangars await Vulture/bomber
          implementation.'
        role: "Capital \xB7 Heavy gunship / carrier"
        iconKey: 026b6c5cca68d9b49918db3c7c0c0a5f:21300000
