        matchups: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e053a1b798d6f5f4d85501286790670d, type: 2}
        description: Fast CIS assault frigate, formerly the Techno Union Frigate.
          Four twin turbolasers, seven turbolasers, two lasers, four point-defense
          cannons and three ion cannons deliver strong offensive firepower. Thin
          shields favor hit-and-run attacks. Power to Weapons temporarily boosts
          offensive output.
        role: Frigate / Fast assault / Hit-and-run
